cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the CAPSM framework in your research, please cite both the software and the underlying thesis."
title: "CAPSM: Cognitive Adaptive Power System Management — Stage-1 Offline Validation on Real OPSD Data"
abstract: >
  Brain-inspired, dual-process AI architecture for real-time control of
  modern power grids with high renewable penetration, FACTS devices, and
  electric-vehicle V2G fleets. System 1 is a CNN-LSTM reflexive controller
  (<5 ms); System 2 is a Quantum-Inspired RL deliberative controller
  (<50 ms); a metacognitive arbiter blends the two based on system stress.
  Validated end-to-end on real measured grid data from the Open Power
  System Data (OPSD) platform over IEEE 9/14/39/118-bus test systems.
